From: Eicke Hecht <eicke.hecht@outlook.de>
Subject: [PATCH] zynqmp: whitelist the eicke A/B env variables

CFG_ENV_FLAGS_LIST_STATIC is a board-header define (not Kconfig), so it
cannot be set from a .cfg fragment. Together with CONFIG_ENV_WRITEABLE_LIST
(set in eicke-te0820.cfg) it restricts which variables may be modified at
runtime or imported from the attacker-writable uboot.env on the FAT boot
partition: the eicke A/B state contract (rootdev/ustate/bootcount, see
doc/images/eicke-update-image.md in meta-eicke), the variables the eicke
bootcmd sets itself, and what U-Boot core and the ZynqMP board code set at
boot. Everything else keeps its compiled-in default.

Only applied for the te0820 machine. The ZynqMP counterpart of the ax7015b
patch for zynq-common.h.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [eicke product configuration]

--- a/include/configs/xilinx_zynqmp.h
+++ b/include/configs/xilinx_zynqmp.h
@@ -198,4 +198,29 @@
 # error "Disable CONFIG_SPL_SYS_MALLOC_SIMPLE. Full malloc needs to be used"
 #endif
 
+/*
+ * eicke: with CONFIG_ENV_WRITEABLE_LIST only the variables below may be set
+ * at runtime or imported from uboot.env, which lives on the attacker-writable
+ * FAT boot partition. Everything else keeps its compiled-in default (a
+ * bootcmd/bootargs override in uboot.env is ignored). The list holds:
+ *  - the eicke A/B state contract (rootdev/ustate/bootcount);
+ *  - the scratch variables the eicke bootcmd and the commands it runs set
+ *    (slot, rootuuid, bootargs, filesize/fileaddr/fdtaddr);
+ *  - what U-Boot core and the ZynqMP board code set at boot (console, MAC,
+ *    fdtcontroladdr, reset_reason/fdtfile/multiboot, modeboot/bootseq/
+ *    boot_targets, dfu_alt_info for capsule updates, script and bootm
+ *    windows). The board code writes these after the env import, so values
+ *    planted in uboot.env do not survive.
+ */
+#define CFG_ENV_FLAGS_LIST_STATIC					\
+	"rootdev:sw,ustate:dw,bootcount:dw,"				\
+	"slot:dw,rootuuid:sw,bootargs:sw,"				\
+	"filesize:xw,fileaddr:xw,fdtaddr:xw,"				\
+	"stdin:sw,stdout:sw,stderr:sw,ver:sw,fdtcontroladdr:xw,"	\
+	"ethaddr:mw,ethact:sw,serial#:sw,"				\
+	"reset_reason:sw,fdtfile:sw,multiboot:xw,"			\
+	"modeboot:sw,bootseq:dw,boot_targets:sw,dfu_alt_info:sw,"	\
+	"scriptaddr:xw,script_offset_f:xw,script_size_f:xw,"		\
+	"bootm_low:xw,bootm_size:xw"
+
 #endif /* __XILINX_ZYNQMP_H */
